<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-SRI LANKA SCORED 234-3 IN ONE-DAY FINAL V AUSTRALIA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA SCORED 234-3 IN ONE-DAY FINAL V AUSTRALIA.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-09-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka scored 234 for three </p>
<p>off 35 overs in the Singer World Series final against Australia</p>
<p>on Saturday.</p>
<p>The match was reduced to 35 overs after early morning rain</p>
<p>delayed the start.</p>
</text>
